{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n早前日本官方預告今年CHIIKAWA聖誕系列商品，可愛造型再次讓大家心動！當中最吸引的是Usagi電動聖誕樹，按一下聖誕樹，兔兔就會自動行走，非常有趣！不過日本方面需要抽選才能買到，好消息好消息，香港朋友也有機會入手啦！11月6日旺角MOKO CHIIKAWA SHOP發售，每人每款限購 1 件，即使不用抽選也可以帶兔兔聖誕樹回家！大家留意啦！\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936928227818004_5529189076ae99496f182b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936928227818004_5529189076ae99496f182b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369282460363465_3731559306ae99498bd3e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369282460363465_3731559306ae99498bd3e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369282598026251_13080284296ae9949a2ecf1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369282598026251_13080284296ae9949a2ecf1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfRJwcfEt_9/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:36.558166+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:00:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:19:04.643458+00:00","content_updated_a